   "design": "In s1 the teacher marks attendance on the learning environment roster on a tablet, so spreadsheet typing drops. Final grades sync from the grade book to the student record system, and the teacher confirms the transfer. The grade book's views replace the separate spreadsheet. Students submit extension requests on a course form that records the decision and new deadline. Rules flag missing grades and attendance below the threshold. The result report takes its statistics from the grade book, and students see their own records. Deciding extensions, checking flags, the commentary and settling issues stay with the teacher.",
